{"step_index":10701,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-26T13:48:50Z","thinking":"A single, high-performance HTML/JS file appears feasible, integrating existing functionalities. This includes file browsing, search, preview, download, real-time \"This PC\" CPU/RAM metrics, a Windows 11-style performance ticker, and a full \"Task Manager\" CPU monitor tab with per-core displays.\n\n\nFocus shifts to modifying the `index.html` file, ensuring existing features like the file explorer remain intact. Implementation targets adding a performance ticker to the title bar, displaying CPU and RAM usage, along with a \"Task Manager\" tab.\nThe \"Task Manager\" tab aims for real-time process monitoring, featuring an animated chart with time ranges, an application rollup, and full process details with search and sorting capabilities. A quick link to the standalone Live Monitor will also be included.\n\n\nConsidering the existing `index.html` file's size, a complete overwrite is being considered to integrate new features. The aim is to create a self-contained HTML file without external dependencies like a `chart.min.js` file, leaning towards a pure vanilla JavaScript canvas for the interactive chart to ensure optimal performance and reliability.\nThe plan incorporates a \"Task Manager\" tab with detailed CPU and RAM monitoring, a live performance ticker, and an easy link to the standalone monitor. Ensuring error handling and code cleanliness are top priorities.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"bn\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no\">\n  <title>This PC - Windows 11 File Explorer & Live CPU Monitor (Azure VM)</title>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Segoe+UI:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --bg-base: #202020;\n      --bg-mica: rgba(32, 32, 32, 0.85);\n      --bg-surface: #2b2b2b;\n      --bg-sidebar: #1f1f1f;\n      --bg-header: #1c1c1c;\n      --bg-hover: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\n      --bg-selected: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n      --border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n      --border-accent: #0078d4;\n      --text-main: #f3f3f3;\n      --text-muted: #a0a0a0;\n      --accent-blue: #60cdff;\n      --accent-fill: #005fb8;\n      --progress-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      --radius-sm: 4px;\n      --radius-md: 8px;\n      --radius-lg: 12px;\n      --font-family: 'Segoe UI', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, \"Noto Sans Bengali\", sans-serif;\n      --green: #2ea043;\n      --yellow: #f0883e;\n      --red: #f85149;\n      --purple: #bc8cff;\n    }\n\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      user-select: none;\n      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      font-family: var(--font-family);\n      background: #0f0f14;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      height: 100vh;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    /* Window Container */\n    .win11-window {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      height: 100vh;\n      background: var(--bg-base);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\n    }\n\n    /* Title Bar */\n    .title-bar {\n      height: 40px;\n      background: var(--bg-header);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 0 12px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .title-left {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      overflow-x: auto;\n    }\n\n    .my-computer-logo {\n      width: 24px;\n      height: 24px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n\n    .tab-bar {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 4px;\n      margin-left: 6px;\n    }\n\n    .win11-tab {\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      border-bottom: none;\n      padding: 6px 14px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0 0;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      transition: all 0.15s ease;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .win11-tab:hover { background: var(--bg-hover); color: var(--text-main); }\n    .win11-tab.active {\n      background: var(--bg-surface);\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      font-weight: 600;\n      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n    }\n\n    /* Performance Ticker in Title Bar */\n    .header-perf-ticker {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n      padding: 4px 10px;\n      border-radius: 14px;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: all 0.15s ease;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .header-perf-ticker:hover {\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n      border-color: var(--accent-blue);\n    }\n    .perf-pulse {\n      width: 8px;\n      height: 8px;\n      background: var(--green);\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--green);\n      animation: pulse-dot 1.5s infinite;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n    @keyframes pulse-dot {\n      0% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }\n      50% { transform: scale(1.3); opacity: 0.5; }\n      100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }\n    }\n    .perf-divider { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); }\n\n    .title-controls {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n\n    .win-btn {\n      width: 44px;\n      height: 38px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      transition: background 0.15s;\n    }\n    .win-btn:hover { background: var(--bg-hover); color: #fff; }\n    .win-btn.close:hover { background: #e81123; color: #fff; }\n\n    /* Command Ribbon */\n    .command-ribbon {\n      height: 48px;\n      background: var(--bg-header);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 0 12px;\n      gap: 6px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      overflow-x: auto;\n    }\n\n    .ribbon-btn {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n      padding: 6px 10px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      border: 1px solid transparent;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      transition: all 0.15s ease;\n    }\n    .ribbon-btn:hover { background: var(--bg-hover); border-color: var(--border-color); }\n    .ribbon-btn.active { background: var(--bg-selected); border-color: var(--accent-blue); }\n    .ribbon-btn svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; flex-shrink: 0; }\n\n    .ribbon-separator {\n      width: 1px;\n      height: 20px;\n      background: var(--border-color);\n      margin: 0 4px;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n\n    /* Address & Search Bar */\n    .address-bar-area {\n      height: 44px;\n      background: var(--bg-header);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 0 12px;\n      gap: 8px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    }\n\n    .nav-btn {\n      width: 32px;\n      height: 32px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      background: transparent;\n      border: none;\n    }\n    .nav-btn:hover:not(:disabled) { background: var(--bg-hover); }\n    .nav-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.3; cursor: not-allowed; }\n    .nav-btn svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; fill: currentColor; }\n\n    .breadcrumbs-box {\n      flex: 1;\n      height: 32px;\n      background: var(--bg-surface);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 0 8px;\n      gap: 4px;\n      overflow-x: auto;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .breadcrumbs-box:focus-within { border-color: var(--accent-blue); }\n\n    .crumb-pill {\n      font-size: 12px;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      padding: 2px 6px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 4px;\n    }\n    .crumb-pill:hover { background: var(--bg-hover); }\n    .crumb-arrow { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 10px; }\n\n    .search-box {\n      width: 240px;\n      height: 32px;\n      background: var(--bg-surface);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 0 10px;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n    .search-box:focus-within { border-color: var(--accent-blue); }\n    .search-input {\n      background: transparent;\n      border: none;\n      outline: none;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      font-size: 12px;\n      width: 100%;\n      font-family: inherit;\n    }\n    .search-input::placeholder { color: var(--text-muted); }\n\n    /* Workspace Body */\n    .workspace-body {\n      flex: 1;\n      display: flex;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n\n    /* Left Sidebar */\n    .sidebar {\n      width: 240px;\n      background: var(--bg-sidebar);\n      border-right: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      padding: 8px 6px;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n\n    .sidebar-section {\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .sidebar-title {\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      padding: 6px 10px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    }\n\n    .sidebar-item {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n      padding: 6px 10px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      font-size: 12px;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: background 0.1s;\n    }\n    .sidebar-item:hover { background: var(--bg-hover); }\n    .sidebar-item.active { background: var(--bg-selected); font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent-blue); }\n    .sidebar-item svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; flex-shrink: 0; }\n\n    /* Content Area (File Explorer) */\n    .content-area {\n      flex: 1;\n      background: var(--bg-base);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      padding: 12px 16px;\n    }\n\n    /* Live Performance Card on This PC */\n    .perf-card-container {\n      background: var(--bg-surface);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      padding: 14px;\n      margin-bottom: 18px;\n    }\n\n    .perf-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));\n      gap: 12px;\n      margin-top: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .perf-box {\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      padding: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .perf-box-header {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\n    }\n\n    .perf-box-title {\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n\n    .perf-box-tag {\n      font-size: 11px;\n      background: #21262d;\n      color: var(--accent-blue);\n      padding: 2px 6px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n\n    .perf-box-value {\n      font-size: 22px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #fff;\n    }\n\n    .core-mini-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n      gap: 4px;\n      margin-top: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .core-mini-item {\n      background: #21262d;\n      padding: 4px 2px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    .core-mini-lbl { font-size: 9px; color: var(--text-muted); }\n    .core-mini-val { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; }\n\n    .top-apps-mini-list {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 6px;\n      margin-top: 6px;\n    }\n\n    .top-app-mini-row {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);\n      padding: 4px 8px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n    }\n    .top-app-mini-name {\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      text-overflow: ellipsis;\n      max-width: 130px;\n    }\n    .top-app-mini-stats {\n      font-weight: 600;\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n\n    /* This PC Drive Cards */\n    .drives-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n      gap: 14px;\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .drive-card {\n      background: var(--bg-surface);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      padding: 12px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 14px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: all 0.15s;\n    }\n    .drive-card:hover {\n      background: var(--bg-hover);\n      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);\n      transform: translateY(-1px);\n    }\n\n    .drive-icon {\n      width: 44px;\n      height: 44px;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n\n    .drive-details {\n      flex: 1;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 4px;\n    }\n\n    .drive-name {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n    }\n\n    .progress-bar-container {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 6px;\n      background: var(--progress-bg);\n      border-radius: 3px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .progress-fill {\n      height: 100%;\n      background: var(--accent-blue);\n      border-radius: 3px;\n      transition: width 0.3s ease, background 0.3s ease;\n    }\n    .progress-fill.warning { background: var(--yellow); }\n    .progress-fill.danger { background: var(--red); }\n\n    .drive-meta {\n      font-size: 11px;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n    }\n\n    /* Section Header */\n    .section-header {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n    }\n\n    .mini-btn {\n      background: var(--bg-surface);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      color: var(--accent-blue);\n      padding: 3px 8px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n    .mini-btn:hover { background: var(--bg-hover); border-color: var(--accent-blue); }\n\n    /* File List Table (Details View) */\n    .files-container {\n      flex: 1;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      background: var(--bg-surface);\n    }\n\n    .files-